### get cats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats

### get cat by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/47

### Get cats by user id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/user/37
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### post new cat
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cat_name": "New Cat",
  "weight": 5,
  "owner": 3333,
  "filename": "https://loremflickr.com/320/240/cat",
  "birthdate": "2022-01-01"
}

### post new cat with image
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cat_name"

Misufsd
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="weight"

6
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="birthdate"

2023-10-08
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="dog.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./dog.jpg
--MyBoundary--


### Modify existing cat
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats/9594
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cat_name": "Frank da CAT",
  "weight": 11,
  "owner": 3609,
  "filename": "f3dbafakjsdfhg4",
  "birthdate": "2021-10-12"
}

### Delete cat by id
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats/9590


# Testing the user routes

### get user
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### get user by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/38

### post new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ulla S",
    "username": "ullas",
    "email": "ullas@metropolia.fi",
    "role": "user",
    "password": "password"
}

### post auth/login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "ullas",
    "password": "password"
}


### Get my user info
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get my cats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/cats/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modify existing user
PUT http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/users/3609
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ulla S",
    "username": "ullas2",
    "email": "ullas@metropolia.fi",
    "role": "admin",
    "password": "password"
}

### Delete cat by user
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/users/3609

